      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778831617834,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V1 chat_agent.py\n    调通LLM请求 - ChatOpenAI\n    使用提示词构造方法 - ChatPromptTemplate\n    管道符 - `chain = prompt | llm`\n    多轮对话 - 管理history存储消息列表",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V1 chat_agent.py\n    调通LLM请求 - ChatOpenAI\n    使用提示词构造方法 - ChatPromptTemplate\n    管道符 - `chain = prompt | llm`\n    多轮对话 - 管理history存储消息列表",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KuIJfhaJbhmVgRKJhX9zv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -178.68960132626103,
      "y": 1493.4686656181186,
      "width": 546.8798217773438,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 420295304,
      "version": 605,
      "versionNonce": 669843273,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778831615651,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V2 photo_rag.py\n    调用embedding模型接口\n    实现多个分块策略\n    封装ChromaDB 照片向量库存储\n    index_photos.py\n        读取“图片描述” / 分块 / Embedding / 入库\n        利用index_manifest.json文件实现变更检测/增量入库",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V2 photo_rag.py\n    调用embedding模型接口\n    实现多个分块策略\n    封装ChromaDB 照片向量库存储\n    index_photos.py\n        读取“图片描述” / 分块 / Embedding / 入库\n        利用index_manifest.json文件实现变更检测/增量入库",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-LbvmWmP82FEVixqbFvIm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -149.91061821142148,
      "y": 1798.1445418401006,
      "width": 479.0399169921875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6628344,
      "version": 754,
      "versionNonce": 72152071,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778832049901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V3 text_to_sql.py\n    go-server提供数据schema，以及数据库查询接口\n    调用LLM把用户问题转换成SQL\n    SQL做安全校验，当前只允许Select操作\n    调用go-server的查询接口\n    美化一下查询结果，回复\n    PS: 这套流程后续是要封装成tools再组装Agent的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V3 text_to_sql.py\n    go-server提供数据schema，以及数据库查询接口\n    调用LLM把用户问题转换成SQL\n    SQL做安全校验，当前只允许Select操作\n    调用go-server的查询接口\n    美化一下查询结果，回复\n    PS: 这套流程后续是要封装成tools再组装Agent的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eH4cv1yBMe6in6Lxhqxhl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -172.68754836566563,
      "y": 2103.2476581670176,
      "width": 781.4797973632812,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1383079465,
      "version": 1019,
      "versionNonce": 209046151,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778832050984,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V4 function_agent.py\n    调通tools的使用，但本脚本只实现一次调用，第二次回复，共两轮LLM调用\n    其实很久以前就已经搞过了，但是当时OpenAI也是刚出Function Call\n    OpenAI-API文档/示例，模型能力，OpenAPI文档，Py构造执行命令/解析执行结果\n    等等各种因素，哪哪都差一点点，导致当时开发很不顺畅，每次调用工具都“开盲盒”",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V4 function_agent.py\n    调通tools的使用，但本脚本只实现一次调用，第二次回复，共两轮LLM调用\n    其实很久以前就已经搞过了，但是当时OpenAI也是刚出Function Call\n    OpenAI-API文档/示例，模型能力，OpenAPI文档，Py构造执行命令/解析执行结果\n    等等各种因素，哪哪都差一点点，导致当时开发很不顺畅，每次调用工具都“开盲盒”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oi6cx_f4b0arhvm5IL9Ow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -156.92610192564212,
      "y": 2316.7321646665446,
      "width": 448.11993408203125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
