      "version": 519,
      "versionNonce": 9279533,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778856132623,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V5 react_agent.py\n    虽然 LangChain 就有 create_react_agent\n    但是还是造轮子搞一个简单的 ReAct 循环试试",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V5 react_agent.py\n    虽然 LangChain 就有 create_react_agent\n    但是还是造轮子搞一个简单的 ReAct 循环试试",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QWwLeZfnZlotcLmMGZUBD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 395.4811275755783,
      "y": 1299.146119813642,
      "width": 468.2799072265625,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 228310407,
      "version": 820,
      "versionNonce": 1418080167,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778831418381,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "流式输出的控制器\n    一开始用简答的公式平滑输出速度效果不好\n    后来用PID算法控制打印的速度\n    总的来说就是\n        开始慢一点，像人类输出速度（活人感）\n        中间速度变化平滑（不跟随LLM-Steam突变）\n        但整体也会追上当前LLM输出进度\n    为什么选PID：纯粹以前玩过，拿来玩玩而已",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "流式输出的控制器\n    一开始用简答的公式平滑输出速度效果不好\n    后来用PID算法控制打印的速度\n    总的来说就是\n        开始慢一点，像人类输出速度（活人感）\n        中间速度变化平滑（不跟随LLM-Steam突变）\n        但整体也会追上当前LLM输出进度\n    为什么选PID：纯粹以前玩过，拿来玩玩而已",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
